The prices command reads explicit standard input.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight prices --format json --file - <<'LEDGER'
commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity STOCK
  format 1,000 STOCK
account Assets:Stock
account Assets:Cash
P 2024-01-01 STOCK 12 SEK

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Stock  10 STOCK {10 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK
LEDGER

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "date": "2024-01-01",
    "baseCommodity": "STOCK",
    "quoteQuantity": "10",
    "quoteCommodity": "SEK",
    "comment": null
  }
]
